sections:
Set the InkProf code folder as Current Folder in MATLAB. Run:
setup_python_environment("sync");
The full pinned requirements are installed in this program's own .venv. Python 3.13.6 must be installed; initial setup may require internet.

Run:
setup_python_environment("check");
paths = setupInkProf(CheckPython=true);
startInkProfApp();
The local environment is isolated from the environments in other programs.
